    <comment>Error dialog body when the server's verify answer for a Play purchase is terminal `invalid` — the proof will never verify (unknown token, disallowed product, canceled before completing). The purchase is still acknowledged with Play so a real charge is not auto-refunded; this dialog is how the failure reaches the user instead of a silent nothing (android google/PlanViewModel.kt report path).</comment>
